ferrohealth-perf follows the design of the performance instruments of
Veredictum (https://github.com/Vernum-Projecten/Veredictum, Copyright 2026
Vernum Projecten B.V. and the Veredictum contributors, Apache License 2.0):
the open-loop arrival schedule with its coordinated-omission correction, the
rank intervals and minimum samples of its quantiles, the steadiness check,
the host fingerprint and the A/A noise floor. The code here is written anew;
no Veredictum file is copied.
